# Lilysplash Mentor: "{1}{G}{U}: Exile another target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's
# control with a +1/+1 counter on it." Bot1's Ornithopter is exiled and returns as a new object (CR 400.7) with one +1/+1 counter
# (CR 122.6), summoning sick again. The ability's "another" refuses the Mentor itself, and "you control" refuses Bot2's
# Ornithopter even though the same card is legal on Bot1's side: both are refused beside the legal target, so each refusal can only
# be the filter. The Mentor itself keeps no counter.

